SUMMARY:Applied Micro – Manudepp Bhuller (University of Oslo) – Perks U
 nder Pressure? Demand Shocks and Firm Provision of Workplace Amenities
LOCATION:Room 404\, FBE Building\, 111 Barry St\, Carlton VIC 3053
DESCRIPTION:Manudepp Bhuller: “Perks Under Pressure? Demand Shocks and Fi
 rm Provision of Workplace Amenities”\nhttps://sites.google.com/site/manu
 deepbhuller\n\nZoom: https://unimelb.zoom.us/j/84741930353?pwd=1TDakj4y62y
 HU6dWbk6ZMFehNtmGMq.1&from=addon\n\nGoogle Maps: https://maps.app.goo.gl/B
 irLkJKurX9pSbBB8\n\nABSTRACT:\nDo firms adjust workplace amenities in resp
 onse to demand shocks? We develop a monopsony framework in which firms joi
 ntly set wages and amenities and show that responses to demand shocks depe
 nd crucially on the structure of amenity provision costs. Using Norwegian 
 data that combine matched employer-employee records\, firms’ cost accoun
 ts\, and non-pecuniary job attributes drawn from job postings\, we exploit
  three distinct sources of firm-level demand shocks: abrupt changes in val
 ue added\, public procurement contract wins\, and export demand shifts. We
  document multi-margin adjustments in amenities alongside wages and employ
 ment\, and discuss implications for the measurement of employer market pow
 er.
URL:https://unimelb.zoom.us/j/84741930353?pwd=1TDakj4y62yHU6dWbk6ZMFehNtmGM
 q.1&from=addon
END:VEVENT
